# Unlike openPDKcreator's own IHP-based dev checkout, data/ here is
# this project's OWN original, authored content (layers, magic tech,
# LEF, DRC) -- the actual deliverable -- so it is tracked, not
# gitignored. Same for saves/ (Magic Types/DRC edits have no other
# tracked home -- they are never written back into data/ itself) and
# export/ (the real, patched open_pdks-format output). Layers live in
# data/.../libs.tech/klayout/tech/openmemristorpdk.lyp itself (plus the
# openmemristorpdk.lyt KLayout technology next to it), so any KLayout
# opens this PDK's GDS with the right layer names, not just this app.
shell_env/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
.cache/

# Regeneratable build artifacts -- real, but reproducible from the
# tracked .va/.sp/.py sources via each docs/simulation/*/run_simulation.sh
# (the original single-device demo lives flat under docs/simulation/
# itself; each later device variant gets its own subdirectory, same
# real .spiceinit + .sp + .csv shape either way).
*.osdi
docs/simulation/.spiceinit
docs/simulation/memristor_tran.csv
docs/simulation/*/.spiceinit
docs/simulation/*/*.csv

# openpdkcreator's own real, tool-owned View Switch xschem menu --
# regenerated on every real launch (pdklib/xschem_view_switch.py's own
# ensure_view_switch_menu), never hand-edited, same regeneratable
# status as the .osdi files above.
**/libs.tech/xschem/openpdkcreator_view_switch_menu

# LaTeX build byproducts.
docs/presentation/*.aux
docs/presentation/*.log
docs/presentation/*.nav
docs/presentation/*.out
docs/presentation/*.snm
docs/presentation/*.toc
docs/presentation/*.vrb
